WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:11.292
I can jump fast.

2
00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:15.411
I can jump slow.

3
00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:20.248
She can jump high.

4
00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:25.068
She can jump low.

5
00:00:25.069 --> 00:00:30.109
He can jump in place.

6
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:35.556
He can jump to and fro.

7
00:00:35.557 --> 00:00:41.628
Look! Look! They can jump in a row!

8
00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:45.756
Let's jump together!

9
00:00:45.757 --> 00:00:51.153
We can jump fast.

10
00:00:51.154 --> 00:00:56.439
We can jump slow.

11
00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:00.458
We can jump high.

12
00:01:00.459 --> 00:01:03.416
We can jump low.

13
00:01:03.417 --> 00:01:08.559
We can jump in place.

14
00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.718
We can jump to and fro.

15
00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:17.292
Look! Look! We can jump in a row!

16
00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:25.426
Let's jump all together!
